    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 16, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "——周一早上。<br>\n执行计划的日子到了。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv11_Narrative001"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 18, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "醒来后，<br>\n我从床上下来，对艾玛打了声招呼。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv11_Narrative002"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 20, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [30.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Hiro.Normal1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 22, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "……早上好，艾玛。", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv11_Hiro001"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 24, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [70.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Ema.Surprised1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 26, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "哎！？啊，什么……？", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv11_Ema001"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 28, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "艾玛惊讶得不知所措。<br>\n这也难怪。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv11_Narrative003"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 30, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "虽然我们生活在一个房间里，<br>\n但我通常都是无视她的存在。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv11_Narrative004"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 32, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Ema.Smile1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 34, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "早、早上好，希罗。", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv11_Ema002"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 36, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "她慌张了一下，<br>\n但还是高兴地给我回了声早安。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv11_Narrative005"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 38, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Ema.Pensive1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 40, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "怎么了？那个……<br>\n因为很少见你跟我打招呼……", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv11_Ema003"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 42, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "不出所料，艾玛虽然惊讶，还是接受了我的示好。<br>\n我若无其事地按照脑海中编排好的计划，继续推进。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv11_Narrative006"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 44, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Hiro.Normal1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 46, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "抱歉。之前是我太固执了。<br>\n但我觉得我们之间不能这样下去了。", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv11_Hiro002"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 48, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "所以，我想和你聊聊以前的事。<br>\n如果你不介意的话……", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv11_Hiro003"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 50, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Ema.Smile1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 52, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "当然可以呀！", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv11_Ema004"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 54, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "话还没说完，艾玛就抢先答道。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv11_Narrative007"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 56, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Hiro.Smile1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 58, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "……谢谢你。那吃完午饭后，<br>\n我们要不要一起去冲个澡？", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv11_Hiro004"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 60, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Ema.Surprised1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 62, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "嗯、嗯，可以是可以……<br>\n但是为什么要冲澡啊？", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv11_Ema005"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 64, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Hiro.Normal1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 66, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "因为白天应该没什么人去淋浴房。<br>\n我想和你两个人单独慢慢聊。<br>\n这样的理由不够充分？", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv11_Hiro005"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 68, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Ema.Smile1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 70, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "……不会呀。<br>\n哎嘿嘿，感觉有点开心。", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv11_Ema006"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 72, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 74, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（艾玛总是这样。<br>\n　露出天真无邪的笑容让人放松警惕，<br>\n　本性其实是个邪恶的人——）", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv11_Hiro006"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 76, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（不，是邪恶的魔女）", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv11_Hiro007"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 78, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我尽量抑制内心的想法，<br>\n对她露出温柔的微笑。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv11_Narrative008"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 80, "indent": 0, "params": {"Scale": [1.0], "Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [30.0, 50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Hiro.Smile1"}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 81, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [70.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Ema.Normal1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 83, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "那，下午2点我们在<br>\n淋浴房见吧。", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv11_Hiro008"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 85, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "还有，这件事<br>\n是我们之间的秘密，希望你能保密。", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv11_Hiro009"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 87, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Ema.Surprised1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 89, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "欸，为什么呢？", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv11_Ema007"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 91, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Hiro.Pensive1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 93, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我不太想被其他人<br>\n打探到自己的情况和过去的经历。", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv11_Hiro010"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 95, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "这确实是我的真心话，但也是个幌子。<br>\n如果被其他少女得知艾玛在失踪前<br>\n约好和我见面，那可就麻烦了。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv11_Narrative009"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 97, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Ema.Smile1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 99, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "这样啊……嗯，我知道了！", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv11_Ema008"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 101, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "ResetText", "line": 102, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "PlaySfxModified", "line": 105, "indent": 0, "params": {"SfxPath": "Sfx_4", "Volume": 1.0, "Loop": 0, "FadeInDuration": 0.0}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 107, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "到了时间，门锁开了。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv11_Narrative010"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 109, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Ema.Normal1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 111, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "……那个，希罗。<br>\n要不要一起吃早饭？", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv11_Ema009"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 113, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 115, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "…………", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv11_Hiro011"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 117, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（我只不过稍微主动示好了一下，<br>\n　就得寸进尺）", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv11_Hiro012"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 119, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（这招我已经见过无数次了。<br>\n　其实她根本没受伤）", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv11_Hiro013"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 121, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（她总是故意装作失败，或是用示弱来吸引同情，<br>\n　一旦自己的处境不利，就立马翻脸）", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv11_Hiro014"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 123, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（你就是这样<br>\n　对小雪见死不救的吧……！）", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv11_Hiro015"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 125, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "艾玛的态度让我心生怒火，用力握紧拳头。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv11_Narrative011"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 127, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 129, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 131, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "……希罗，你怎么了？<br>\n我是不是说了什么惹你不开心的话？", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv11_Ema010"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 133, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 134, "indent": 0, "params": {"Scale": [1.0], "Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0, 50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Hiro.Normal1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 136, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "……不，没什么。走吧。", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv11_Hiro016"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 138, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 140, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（很快就能斩断这令人恼火的根源了）", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv11_Hiro017"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 142, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "艾玛欢欣雀跃地走出牢房，<br>\n而我却跟在她身后，静静酝酿着阴暗的感情。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv11_Narrative012"]}},
    {"op": "Gosub", "line": 144, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "System/System_Subroutine.EndAdv"}},
